The redline-dispatch and redline-rocr crates implement an auditable
capture/replay dispatch runtime against the public ROCr/HSA ABI. No ROCm
implementation source is vendored; see the pinned external Redline checkout's
crates/redline-rocr/PROVENANCE.md for ABI provenance.

